---
title: "reserve::mint_ctokens (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_zero: collateral_amount = coin.value()
    q_check_zero --> q_error_zero: collateral_amount == 0
    q_check_zero --> q_calc_mint: collateral_amount > 0
    q_error_zero --> [*]: abort reserve_zero_coin_not_allowed
    q_calc_mint --> q_deposit: mint_amount = collateral_amount / exchange_rate
    q_deposit --> q_increase_supply: deposit_underlying(coin)
    q_increase_supply --> [*]: increase_ctoken_supply(mint_amount)

    note right of q_calc_mint
        INV-001: mint_amount = floor(collateral_amount / exchange_rate)
        INV-002: cash increases by collateral_amount
        INV-003: total_supply increases by mint_amount
        INV-004: underlying_balance.join(coin)
    end note
